<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">- Adele Old Testament</book>
  <para style="rem">Team Checks November 2024; Consultant Checks December 2024</para>
  <para style="h">Esita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esita Gɩkpa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esita</para>
  <para style="toc3">Esi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Esita</para>
  <para style="mt2">Gɩkpa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EST 1" />
  <para style="s1">Be tiri egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Fasiti be ye bugyu buu gedi baanɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 1:1" />Ade gɛtɛ i sere Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi wɔya waanɩ fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ. Herihesi e di bugyu ɛ tɛ ntʋnkwaa akpilin kooron ma kwarankɩ (127) ye Indiya ka ma sere Etiyopiya. <verse eid="EST 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 1:2" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi ɛ sara wo gigyu-bɩya gii koro e di bugyu ditele-dɩrɛ Susa daanɩ. <verse eid="EST 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 1:3" />Gɛ wo bugyu buu gedi wuu gɩkyan-siyeefɛ gaanɩ fɔ, e kpèlè wo gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ, ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi powu ɔsɛ wuu gedi. Fɔ Perisiya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ ma Mediya woyo ɛbɛ powu, fɩya ma ntʋnkwaa-kurumakyɛɛ buu begyu boo bebi ma boo gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ ba dʋkɔ.<verse eid="EST 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 1:4" />Egyu Herihesi e di ɔsɛ awi-kpara-kpara akpilin yɛkɩ (180) ɛ ka e tiri wo bugyu buu gedikʋn bʋʋ gɩkyɩnyɩn-dɩrɛ, ma gɩɩmɩrɩ, ma gii gingyebi ma gii gebù e wùlà. <verse eid="EST 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 1:5" />Gɛtɛ awi fɔ i were fɔ, Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi e kpèlè ditele-dɩrɛ Susa dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu, beyenpu ma kɔba bete ɛ tɛ awi kwarankɩ yɩɩsɛ yii gedi digyu-kpaara, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ bɛkɔkɔkɔ fɔ. <verse eid="EST 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 1:6" />Bɛ ka ayan-fututu ma buluu ma ayan nkeni butu bɛ sa digyu-kpaara fɔ ɔmɩrɩ. Bɛ ka yɩ bɛ ma gye ma sɩka-fututu butola gɛtɛ bʋ̀ marama ataa-ŋalagɩlɛ ma ɔyɛkɛma yii bepila fɔ. Gɛ bɛ sɩ̀ sɩka-sɩya ma sɩka-fututu yaasarakʋn bɛ gyaga ataa-ŋalagɩlɛ ma ɔyɛkɛma kperen-kperen fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="EST 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 1:7" />Bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya bɛkɔpʋ kperen-kperen be yo wayɩn bʋkan bɛ tɛ bɛ, gɛ egyu wɔ wayɩn e gbintin gɛtɛ ɛkamasɛ ɛɛ nyʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ è len. <verse eid="EST 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 1:8" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ tɛ wɔ bɛsaranyan fɔ powu ose alɛ, wù di gɛtɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nyʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ è len. Mɔ bɛ kara nyɩ̀ ɛkɩ alɛ ɛ nyʋn ɛ da wo gelenbi.<verse eid="EST 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 1:9" />Fɔ Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Fasiti mɔ e kpèlè bɛnanɩ gɛtɛ bè si Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi dɩkpaara fɔ gɛ bee di ɔsɛ.<verse eid="EST 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 1:10" />Duwi-kwarankɩfɛ fɔ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi bʋkan gɛtɛ ɛ nyʋn fɔ bʋ da wɔ bɛrɛɛ, ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛsaranyan kwarankɩ Mehuman, ma Bisita, ma Haribona, ma Bigita, ma Abagita, ma Seta ma Karikasi gɛtɛ be tiri bɛ aforobi gɛ bɛɛ sʋma wɔ fɔ alɛ, <verse eid="EST 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 1:11" />bɛ yɛ egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Fasiti èè tin wo digyu-koto, fɔ bàà ka wɔ bɛ mɔma wɔ. Fɔ egyu ee len èè tiri Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ gʋsʋgʋgyan ma wɔmɩrɩ e wùlà bɛnɩ fɔ, ma gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ fɔ. <verse eid="EST 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 1:12" />Mɔ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ bɛsaranyan fɔ bɛ ma dɔ̀ Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Fasiti ɔtʋn fɔ, e terema alɛ ɛn nan ba. Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ka owurufa gepepe.<verse eid="EST 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 1:13" />Fɔ wù di ɔkɔnʋ gɛtɛ ade anlɛ nyayɩ yaanɩ fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ yɛ bɛsɛyɩlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ise yaade, ma gɔdɔ gɩɩ gɛdɔ̀ ma giisele fɔ, bàà tɛ wɔ dɩmɩnlɛ. Okoro e kpèlè wɔ bɛsɛyɩlɛ bàà wùlà wɔ gɩnyan gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ. <verse eid="EST 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 1:14" />Bɛsɛyɩlɛ nyabɛ n di Perisiya ma Mediya bengyebi kwarankɩ gɛtɛ ɛbɛ n gbɛma egyu-dɩrɛ, gɛ bɔɔ bɩndɩrɛ bʋ da ɛkamasɛ egyu-dɩrɛ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ powu baanɩ fɔ. Baayere n di Karisena, ma Setari, ma Adimata, ma Tarisisi, ma Meresi, ma Marisena, ma Memukan.<verse eid="EST 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 1:15" />Gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Lan gɛ ǹ mɛ Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Fasiti gɛtɛ na sa mɩɩn bɛsaranyan alɛ bɛ ma kpèlè wɔ, gɛ e terema ɛn ba lɛ? Lan gɛ ise fɔ ii wùlà ka da ma ade nyayɩ yii koro?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 1:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Memukan e tiri ade fɔ yii-inyun egyu-dɩrɛ ma wo gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Nka awɔ egyu-dɩrɛ aako gɛ Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Fasiti e toro, mɔ fɔ, e toro gɛ gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ, ma bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa aa-ɩlanlan yaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="EST 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 1:17" />Yema bɛnanɩ powu baà nʋn egyu-nanɩ wade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ lɛ, gɛ waà yɛ bɛ bɛn nan nɩ bù bɔɔsan ɛbɛ. Baà dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Egyu Herihesi ɛ sa alɛ bɛ ma ka Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Fasiti bɛ mɔma wɔ, mɔ e terema ɛn ba.&gt; <verse eid="EST 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 1:18" />Nkele mɔ, ǹdò wuu duwi nyadɩ gengyi Perisiya ma Mediya bɔɔ bɛnanɩ gɛtɛ bɛ ba gebù ma gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ bɔɔsɔ ɛbɛ bɛ̀ nʋn Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Fasiti wade nyayɩ fɔ waà yɛ bɛn nan ni bù bɔɔsan ɛbɛ, gɛ waà ka gɛmanbù, ma otiira wʋ ba. <verse eid="EST 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 1:19" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro awɔ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi, gengyi waà sara ma awɔ fɔ, sɩ̀ ose, fɔ àà yɛ bàà ŋwara wʋ bɛ sa Mediya ma Perisiya wo-ise fɔ yaanɩ, fɔ ose fɔ wàà sara gakpaakpa alɛ, Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Fasiti ɛ kara ka wɔ gɩsɩrɩ e sere aa bʋnʋn kpakpaakpa. Fɔ àà sɩ̀ Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ-fon gɛtɛ ɛ̀ kɔlɔ da ɛwɔ. <verse eid="EST 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 1:20" />Fɔ gengyi bɛnanɩ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa aa bugyu buu gedikʋn bɛ̀ nʋn ose-fon nyawʋ fɔ, bɔɔsan ɛbɛ bè di beyenpu oo, bè di bɛnɩ gbaa-gbaa oo, baà bù bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 1:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi ma wo gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ fɔ be to Memukan wade nyayɩ bɛ sa, gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Memukan ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="EST 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 1:22" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ŋwara akpa ɛ tɩyɛma ɩkʋn gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa wɔ gatɩn fɔ powu, gɛtʋnkwaa-kamasɛ gii ginde ma gɩɩ gɛŋwarabi gaanɩ alɛ, wù di gɛtɛ eteni-kamasɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ duyu wɔ dɩkpaara daanɩ.<verse eid="EST 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EST 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛ sɩ̀ Esita bugyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 2:1" />Gamaama gɛtɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi woturu wʋ nʋ̀n wɔ fɔ, ɛ kʋna Fasiti wade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ, ma ose gɛtɛ ɛ sɩ̀ ka da ma wo koro fɔ. <verse eid="EST 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 2:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gbɛma wɔ fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ taà ma bugiti bɛsʋgʋgyan-bi ma ɔmɩrɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛn nyɩ̀ bete tɩ tɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="EST 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 2:3" />Egyu ɛ̀ talɩ e tiri bɛndɩrɛbi ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ baà ka bɛsʋgʋgyanbi ma ɔmɩrɩ fɔ be ye ntʋnkwaa fɔ powu baanɩ bɛ ba ditele-dɩrɛ Susa fɔ daanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ awɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ aa bɛnanɩ bɛ̀ sa fɔ. Ka bɛsʋgʋgyan ma ɔmɩrɩ fɔ sa aasaranyan Hegayi gɛtɛ be tiri aforobi gɛ ɛ̀ fʋrʋma ɛɛ nya bɛnanɩ boo koro fɔ gʋlɔ. Fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ yɛ bàà pɩna bɛsʋgʋgyan fɔ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ yɛ bàà nya boo koro bàà mɛ ɔmɩrɩ gepepe. <verse eid="EST 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 2:4" />Fɔ àà tiri ɛsʋgʋgyan gɛtɛ ee di wɔ gʋnʋn fɔ mɛ egyu-nanɩ sere Fasiti gɩsɩrɩ.&gt;&gt; Egyu Herihesi e to amɩnlɛ fɔ ɛ sa, gɛ ɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ.<verse eid="EST 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 2:5" />Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ Yuda-te ɛkɩ gɛtɛ e ye Benyamin wofoli waanɩ gɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Modekayi fɔ è si Susa ditele daanɩ. Wote n di Yari, gɛ wotu n di Simeyi, gɛ Simeyi wote n di Kisi. <verse eid="EST 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 2:6" />Modekayi nyawɔ ɛ̀ fɩya ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ Babilon wogyu Nebukadinesa e gye Yerusalem ditele daanɩ ɛ san gisela, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ e gye Yuda wogyu Yehoyakin bɩtà ɛ san Babilon ditele fɔ. <verse eid="EST 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 2:7" />Fɔ Modekayi woteti wobi ɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Hadasa fɔ è si wakʋn, yema ɛn ma ɛtaawe gɛ ɛn ma ɛnaawe. Bè biri bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Esita, e ye gʋsʋgʋgyan gepepe, gɛ Modekayi e ton wɔ anlɛ ɛwɔ gbagba wobi ɔya gɛtɛ Esita wote ma wɔna be ku fɔ.<verse eid="EST 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 2:8" />Gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛ nʋn Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi wade ma wose gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ̀ fɔ, bɛ ka bɛsʋgʋgyan kpekpesi bɛ bɛ kʋla ditele-dɩrɛ Susa gɛ bɛ ka bɛ bɛ sa Hegayi gʋlɔ. Fɔ Esita mɔ ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ. Bɛ ka bɛsʋgʋgyan nyabɛ powu bɛ sa Hegayi gɛtɛ ɛwɔ n tɛ nya egyu-dɩrɛ wo bɛnanɩ boo koro fɔ gʋlɔ. <verse eid="EST 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 2:9" />Esita wade i di wɔ gʋnʋn gɛ e wùlà wɔ gutunkoro. Disere-kɩlɩn fɔ, e sere ɔpɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya wo koro gepepe, gɛ ɛɛ tɛ wɔ anyan-dɩlɛ-kpara. Gɛ e tiri bɛsʋgʋgyan kwarankɩ e ye digyu-kpaara fɔ daanɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ sʋma wɔ, gɛ ɛ ka ɛwɔ ma ɛbɛ ɛ ma sɩ̀ ɔkʋn-kparakʋn.<verse eid="EST 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 2:10" />Esita ɛn dɔ̀ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ e ye abɛɛ wɔ dɩkpaara daade ɛ tɛ ɛkɩ, yema Modekayi ɛ sʋ wɔ ɛ sa. <verse eid="EST 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 2:11" />Duwi-kamasɛ, Modekayi ɛɛ bʋn ɛ waran digyu-kpaara ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Esita ɛ̀ sa fɔ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nya alɛ anʋn ntɛ mɛ wɔ, gɛ lan gɛ è si.<verse eid="EST 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 2:12" />Pɛ bɛsʋgʋgyan nyabɛ baanɩ ɛkɩ èè wura osele ɛ san Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi wakʋn fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ èè werema bebon fwo-bɛnyɔɔ, gɛtɛ bɛ sɩ̀ bɛ alɛ, bɛ ka bɛ pɩna boo koro fɔ pɛ. Bɛ ka bebon kooron bɛ sʋrʋ olife bʋnɔ ma mire gɛ bɛ ka bebon kooron mɔ bɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ-sʋrʋlɛ ma ofèn. <verse eid="EST 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 2:13" />Nkele mɔ, pɛ bɛsʋgʋgyan fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ eè gyu ɛ san egyu-dɩrɛ wakʋn fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ bàà tɛ wɔ anyan gɛtɛ ee len powu, ye egyu-dɩrɛ bɛnanɩ bɔɔ dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="EST 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 2:14" />Ɔgyɔlɔ fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ tɔ ɛ san egyu-dɩrɛ wakʋn. Kere gɩ̀ kpa gagyɩgyan fɔ ɛɛ̀ tɔ e ye egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara ɛ san egyu-dɩrɛ bɛnanɩ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ. Egyu-dɩrɛ wɔsaranyan Saasigasi n tɛ nya egyu-dɩrɛ bedima boo koro. Wun di gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nɩ san egyu-dɩrɛ wakʋn ɛ nya, sɩyɛɛ egyu-dɩrɛ gbagba n te len wɔ, fɔ ɛ ka wo diyere ɛ tɛ alɛ, bɛ ma kpèlè wɔ, pɛ fɔ, ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba.<verse eid="EST 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 2:15" />Gɛtɛ ɔya wʋ nɩma wʋ tɛ Esita gɛtɛ è di Modekayi woteti Abiyali wobi gɛtɛ e ton wɔ anlɛ ɛwɔ gbagba wobi ɛ̀ɛ̀ san egyu-dɩrɛ wakʋn fɔ, en lila gɩnyankɩ. Hegayi gɛtɛ be tiri aforobi, gɛ ɛɛ nya egyu-dɩrɛ bɛnanɩ boo koro fɔ, gɛ e lila alɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ amɩnlɛ. Gɛ Esita e di ɛkamasɛ gɛtɛ e we wɔ fɔ gʋnʋn. <verse eid="EST 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 2:16" />Egyu Herihesi wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-kwarankɩfɛ giibon-fwofɛ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Tebeti fɔ wanɩ gɛ bɛ ka Esita bɛ san ma wɔ, wo digyu-kpaara daanɩ.<verse eid="EST 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 2:17" />Esita wade ɩ mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɔmɩrɩ ɩ da bɛnanɩ fɔ powu. Gɛ bɛsʋgʋgyan gɛtɛ bɛɛn nyɩ̀ bete fɔ powu baanɩ fɔ, Esita na di wɔ gʋnʋn gepepe da bekurumakyɛɛ. Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ka digyu-koto e tin Esita, gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ wɔ bugyu e sere Fasiti bɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="EST 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 2:18" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ e kpèlè bɛnɩ ɔsɛ wuu gedi gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka bʋma Esita diyere. Ɛ fɩna gʋlɔ e kpèlè wo gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu, ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi powu. Egyu e tiri duwi ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ bàà sara gɛtɛ bɛ kara mɛ gʋtʋn gɩfɩɩ fɔ powu gaanɩ. Gɛ ɛ kyɛ bɛ anyan anlɛ gɛtɛ wù di gɛtɛ egyu ɛ̀ɛ̀ tɛ.<verse eid="EST 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Modekayi e to egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 2:19" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bɛsʋgʋgyan gɛtɛ bɛɛn nyɩ̀ bete fɔ be tuma disere-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ, Modekayi è si egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara diitunu. <verse eid="EST 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 2:20" />Mɔ Esita ɛn dɔ̀ ɛnɩ n di ɛnɩ ade ɩkɩ ka da ma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ boo koro abɛɛ wo geyekʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ Modekayi ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sʋ wɔ fɔ. Yema ɛ̀ bɔ ɛ̀ tɛrɛma Modekayi wade-wùlàlɛ anlɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ è di ebi gɛ è si wakʋn fɔ.<verse eid="EST 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 2:21" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Modekayi è si egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara diitunu ɛɛ dɩyɛ dʋkɔ fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ bɛndɩrɛbi bɛnyɔɔ, Bigitana ma Teresi gɛtɛ be tiri bɛ aforobi fɔ, n tɛ dɩyɛ egyu-dɩrɛ wo dikwo diitunu. Bɛ ka owurufa egyu-dɩrɛ wo koro, gɛ bɛ mɛ onyun wo koro gɛtɛ baà wolo wɔ. <verse eid="EST 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 2:22" />Mɔ Modekayi ɛ nʋn amɩnlɛ-kpen gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ-nanɩ Esita, gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ ɛ ma dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ ade gɛtɛ Modekayi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ, fɔ waà wura bʋma Modekayi. <verse eid="EST 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 2:23" />Gɛ gɛtɛ be gyu ade fɔ yaanɩ gɛ be we gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa waanɩ fɔ, bɛ sa bɛsaranyan bɛnyɔɔ fɔ gigyen ɔŋʋʋ bɛ kyɔlɔga ma iyon. Bɛ ŋwara ade nyayɩ powu bɛ sa begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ, egyu-dɩrɛ bʋnʋn.<verse eid="EST 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EST 3" />
  <para style="s1">Haman ɛ mɛ gɛtɛ èè muru Yuda bete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 3:1" />Ade nyayɩ yɩɩ gama fɔ, Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi ɛ bʋma Agagi-te Hamedata wobi Haman bɩndɩrɛ, gɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ gɛsarakʋn-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ gɩ da bɛndɩrɛbi-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ powu. <verse eid="EST 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 3:2" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa digyu-tele diitunu fɔ ose gɛtɛ ɛkamasɛ èè ti kura Haman gebù gaanɩ. Mɔ Modekayi bɩrɛ ɛn taa kura Haman ɛ tɛ wɔ gebù.<verse eid="EST 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 3:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bè si egyu-dɩrɛ wotunu fɔ be lila Modekayi alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ an taa di egyu-dɩrɛ wose fɔ wuu koro?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EST 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 3:4" />Duwi n di duwi fɔ, bɛɛ tabʋrʋ bɛ tɛ wɔ, mɔ ɛn taa nʋn baakʋn. Gɛlɛ wuu koro bɛ ma dɔ̀ ade fɔ bɛ tɛ Haman bàà nya alɛ baà ka Modekayi wade fɔ bɛ kyɛ wɔ, yema ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ è di gɛ Yuda-te okoro.<verse eid="EST 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 3:5" />Gɛtɛ Haman e we gɛtɛ Modekayi ɛn nan kura wɔ ɛ tɛ wɔ gebù fɔ, wowurufa wʋ tɔ. <verse eid="EST 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 3:6" />Gɛ gɛtɛ ɛ nʋn alɛ Modekayi è di gɛ Yuda-te fɔ, ɛ mɛ wamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ ɛn nan wolo gɛ Modekayi woko, mɔ fɔ, ee bugiti osele gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka muru Modekayi bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ bè si Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi bugyu buu gedikʋn powu fɔ.<verse eid="EST 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 3:7" />Egyu Herihesi bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-nyɔɔfɛ giibon-gyangbasɛlɛ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Nisan wanɩ fɔ, gɛ Haman ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛnɩ alɛ bàà da ma Puri wataa yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀ yii koro bàà ka tiri duwi ma ebon gɛtɛ wanɩ baà mɛ ade fɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ wʋ ma sere ebon fwo-nyɔɔfɛ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Ada fɔ.<verse eid="EST 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 3:8" />Gɛ Haman ɛ ma dɔ̀ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛnɩ bɛkɩ bɛ̀ sa gɛtɛ bɛ yasɩ be gyu aa gɩfɩɩ fɔ gaanɩ ɔkʋn-kamasɛ. Gɛ baade-mɛlɛ ì we kperen ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ, gɛ bɛn taa di awɔ egyu aa-ise fɔ yii koro. Wun di gɛtɛ àà sara nya bɛ bàà mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ. <verse eid="EST 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 3:9" />Gengyi wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ wɔ fɔ, sɩ̀ ose bàà muru bɛ powu, gɛ nan ka sɩka-fututu bekotoku ɩgbaa ton (10,000) n bɛ sa gigyu-bɩya gɩɩ dɩdaka daanɩ gɛtɛ bàà ka le ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ gutoro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 3:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e lo wo gitola gɛtɛ wɔ dɩdawʋ dɩ̀ gyaga gii koro fɔ e ye wɔ gʋlɔ gaanɩ ɛ tɛ Hamedata wobi Haman, gɛtɛ e ye Agagi gɛ ɛɛ kyʋn Yuda bete fɔ. <verse eid="EST 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 3:11" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Haman alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ yɛ sɩka-fututu fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sara aakʋn, mɔ fɔ, mɛ bɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ aa len.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 3:12" />Ebon-gyangbasɛlɛ wo duwi fwo-siyefɛ daanɩ fɔ, be kpèlè egyu-dɩrɛ gɩkpa gɩɩ bɛŋwaralɛ be tuma, gɛ bɛ yɛ bɛ bɛ ŋwara akpa anlɛ gɛtɛ Haman e wùlà bɛ fɔ. Bɛ ŋwara yɩ ma gɩfɩɩ-kamasɛ gii ginde gaanɩ, ma gɩɩ gɛŋwarabi. Bɛ ŋwara akpa fɔ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi diyere daanɩ, gɛ bɛ ka wo gitola-dɩrɛ fɔ bɛ nyɩ akpa fɔ yii koro. Gɛ bɛ ka yɩ bɛ san ma egyu-dɩrɛ bɛndɩrɛbi powu, gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya bɩfɩɩ kperen-kperen ma bʋʋ bɛnɩ powu boo koro fɔ. <verse eid="EST 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 3:13" />Okoro bɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ka akpa fɔ bɛ san bɩfɩɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa egyu-dɩrɛ gatɩn fɔ powu baanɩ. Gɛ anyun-gyebi gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa akpa fɔ yaanɩ n di alan, &lt;&lt;Ebon-fwo-nyɔɔfɛ wo duwi fwo-siyeefɛ daanɩ fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ duwi-kɩlɩn dɩtɔkɔ daanɩ fɔ, bàà wolo Yuda bɛnɩ powu be muru. Wù di gɛtɛ bàà wolo bebi-sʋgʋgyanbi, ma bɛsaranyanbi, ma bɛndɩrɛ, ma bɛnanɩ, ma bebi-sorobi powu, fɔ bàà kpila baanyan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EST 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 3:14" />Baà gbɛrɛ gɩkpa fɔ gaade yii digbongbo, ɔkʋn-kamasɛ bɛ tɛ bɩfɩɩ, bɩfɩɩ bʋʋ bɛnɩ, fɔ bàà wura nʋn yɩ, fɔ bàà pɩna koro bɛ tɛ duwi dɩtɔkɔ.<verse eid="EST 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 3:15" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ e tiri bɛnɩ-salɛ osele gɛtɛ bàà yo akpa fɔ bilenten, gɛ bɛ sɩ̀ ose nyawʋ Susa ditele daanɩ. Gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi ma Haman bɛ waran bɛ sara bɛɛ nyʋn bʋkan, mɔ fɔ, ditele-dɩrɛ Susa dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɩrɛ, bɛ̀ sa getutu dɩrɛ gaanɩ.<verse eid="EST 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EST 4" />
  <para style="s1">Modekayi ɛ fɔ gɛkpà e ye Esita wakʋn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 4:1" />Gɛtɛ Modekayi ɛ nʋn ade powu gɛtɛ i sere fɔ, ɛ fɛɛran wɔ ngba, gɛ ɛ sa bekotoku bɔɔ ngba, gɛ ɛ ka bʋtɔ e tin wo duyu. Gɛ ɛ tɔ ɛ da ditele daanɩ ɛɛ gbɛrɛ afala-kin-kin ee wula gɛtɛ ɛn taa kere ɛ ya. <verse eid="EST 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 4:2" />Mɔ ɛ bɔ ɛ san ɛ ma ten gɛ egyu dɩkpara diitunu, yema ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn ma osele ɛ̀ sa bekotoku gyu dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="EST 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 4:3" />Gɛtʋnkwaa-kamasɛ gaanɩ gɛtɛ bɛ kalan egyu-dɩrɛ wose fɔ, Yuda bete bɛ sara dɩkpʋkpʋ-dɩrɛ ma onyun wʋʋ gɛban ma gɛtʋrʋn yaanɩ. Yuda bete fɔ bɛ sa bekotoku bɔɔ ngba, gɛ bɛ kpà bʋtɔ be lù baayu.<verse eid="EST 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 4:4" />Gɛtɛ Esita bɛsʋgʋgyan, ma wɔ bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ be tiri aforobi fɔ bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade gɛtɛ Modekayi ɛ mɛ fɔ, e gyu dɩyɩyɛ-dɩrɛ daanɩ. Gɛ ɛ sa bɛ alɛ bɛ ka ayan bɛ sa ma Modekayi fɔ èè tiri bekotoku bɔɔ ngba fɔ, mɔ en yera. <verse eid="EST 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 4:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Esita e kpèlè egyu-dɩrɛ wɔsaranyan Hataki gɛtɛ be tiri aforobi gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e tiri wɔ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ tɩ mɛ gʋtʋn tɛ ɛwɔ Esita fɔ alɛ ɛ san ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma nya alɛ, anʋn n de Modekayi.<verse eid="EST 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 4:6" />Okoro Hataki ɛ san Modekayi wakʋn ditele fɔ dii getumakʋn, digyu-kpaara diitunu wʋʋ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="EST 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 4:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Modekayi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade powu gɛtɛ ì de wɔ fɔ, ma sɩka-fututu wɔkʋna gɛtɛ Haman ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ alɛ, eè le ɛ sa gigyu-bɩya gɩɩ gatɩn fɔ, gɛtɛ bàà ka be wolo Yuda bete fɔ. <verse eid="EST 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 4:8" />Modekayi e biri ɛ ka gɩkpa gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara, gɛ gɩɩ tɛ ose bàà muru Yuda bete fɔ gɛ bɛ gbɛrɛ gii digbongbo Susa ditele powu daanɩ ɛ tɛ Ataki. Gɛ Modekayi ɛ dɔ̀ Hataki alɛ ɛ ka gɩkpa fɔ ɛ ma wùlà Esita, fɔ èè tiri gaanɩ tɛ wɔ. Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san egyu-dɩrɛ wakʋn, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma koturu egyu-dɩrɛ, fɔ èè wula ɛwɔ Esita bɛnɩ gutunkoro.<verse eid="EST 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 4:9" />Okoro Hataki e biri ɛ san Esita wakʋn ɛ ma dɔ̀ wɔ ade gɛtɛ Modekayi ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="EST 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 4:10" />Gɛ Esita ɛ dɔ̀ Hataki alɛ ɛ ma dɔ̀ Modekayi alan, <verse eid="EST 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 4:11" />&lt;&lt;Egyu bɛndɩrɛbi ma ntʋnkwaa fɔ bʋʋ bɛnɩ powu bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ eteni ɛkɩ abɛɛ ɛnanɩ ɛkɩ ɛɛn talɩ ɛ san digyu-kpaara gɛtɛ egyu en kpèlè wɔ, yema ose wʋ̀ sa gɛtɛ baà wolo wɔ. Mɔ gengyi egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ tʋna wo bugyu buuyon-tonlɛ fɔ e wùlà ɛnɩ fɔ, ɛwʋ bɩrɛ, bɛn nan wolo wɔ. Mɔ awi dikpilin ma fwo ɩ lɛ, gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ en kpèlè mɩ wo digyu-kpaara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 4:12" />Gɛtɛ bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Modekayi Esita wanyun-gyebi fɔ, <verse eid="EST 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 4:13" />Modekayi e biri e tiri ade fɔ yiinyun alan, &lt;&lt;Kara sa amɩnlɛ alɛ à si digyu-kpaara wuu koro, awɔ aako aà ye waanɩ gengyi bee wolo Yuda bete fɔ. <verse eid="EST 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 4:14" />Okoro gengyi à gye aanyun a tin ɔya nyawʋ waanɩ fɔ, Yuda bete bɩrɛ, Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ̀ talɩ ɛ kpà bɛ bàà wura getoya. Mɔ baà muru awɔ ma aate dɩkpaara. Ɛnyan n nyɩ̀? Nkɩfɔ ɛtɩ taade nyayɩ yii koro gɛ bɛ sɩ̀ wɔ̀ egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ ɔkʋna nyawʋ lɛ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 4:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Esita e tiri ade fɔ yiinyun ɛ tɩyɛma Modekayi alan, <verse eid="EST 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 4:16" />&lt;&lt;San ma kʋla Yuda bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Susa ditele daanɩ fɔ, fɔ yàà ban onyun ɩ tɛ mɩ. Ɩ kara di gɛ ɩ kara nyʋn gɛlɛɛ awi asiyee odon ma ofilibo. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ nmɩ ma mɩɩn bɛsʋgʋgyan mɔ taà mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ yaà mɛ fɔ. Tɩ̀ mɛ gɛlɛ ti were fɔ, nan san egyu wakʋn, ma gɛtɛ ose fɔ wʋn taa tɛ osele gba fɔ. Gɛ gengyi na ku fɔ, wu were!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 4:17" />Okoro Modekayi ɛ tɔ ɛ da, gɛ ɛ ma mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Esita ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ powu.<verse eid="EST 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EST 5" />
  <para style="s1">Esita ɛ san egyu-dɩrɛ wakʋn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 5:1" />Duwi-siyeefɛ fɔ, Esita ɛ sa wo bugyu bʋʋ ngba-serelɛ fɔ, gɛ ɛ ma yela digyu-kpaara, egyu-dɩrɛ wɔ kpata bʋnʋn. Fɔ egyu-dɩrɛ è si wo gigyu-bɩya gii koro, gɛ wɔ bʋnʋn bù ten wɔ dɩkpaara fɔ diitunu. <verse eid="EST 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 5:2" />Gɛtɛ e we Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Esita è yela dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ fɔ, ɛ mɛ Esita gɛbwala gɛ ɛ tʋna wo bugyu buuyon-tonlɛ dɩrɛ fɔ e wùlà wɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ Esita ɛ san wakʋn, gɛ ɛ tʋna gʋlɔ ɛ kya egyu-dɩrɛ wo bugyu buuyon-dɩrɛ fɔ wuunyun.<verse eid="EST 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 5:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-nanɩ Esita, anʋn n de wɔ? Anʋn gɛ aa buguti? Gengyi miin bugyu buu gedikʋn nyabʋ dikpen dɩkɩ gba gɛ à len fɔ, nan ka n tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 5:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Esita e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ, gengyi waà sara ma awɔ fɔ, n len gɛtɛ awɔ ma Haman yàà ba ɔsɛ gɛtɛ ǹdò na pɩna na sɩ̀ wɔ̀ lɛ waanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 5:5" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ma ka Haman ɩ mɔma mɩ bilenten fɔ taà ma mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Esita e lila fɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 5:5">Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ ma Haman bɛ tɔ bɛ san Esita wɔsɛ fɔ wuu gedi gaanɩ. <verse eid="EST 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 5:6" />Gɛtɛ bè si bɛɛ nyʋn wayɩn fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ e biri e lila Esita alan, &lt;&lt;Nkele dɔ̀ mɩ, anʋn gɛ aa len nàn mɛ n tɛ wɔ̀? Anʋn gɛ aa hiyan? Gengyi terema miin bugyu buu gedikʋn bʋʋfan gba gɛ aa bugiti fɔ, nan ka n tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 5:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Esita alan, &lt;&lt;Maade gɛtɛ nte len ma maade hiyanlɛ n di alɛ, <verse eid="EST 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 5:8" />gengyi awɔ egyu-dɩrɛ aà we mɩ gutunkoro, gɛ aà to maade gɛtɛ nte len fɔ a sa, fɔ àà mɛ maade hiyanlɛ a tɛ mɩ fɔ, nte len gɛtɛ gɩsa awɔ egyu-dɩrɛ, ma Haman yàà ɩ ba ɔsɛ gɛtɛ nan pɩna n tɛ yɩ fɔ waanɩ. Dʋkɔ fɔ, nan dɔ̀ wɔ̀ ade gɛtɛ nte len.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haman ɛ mɛ gɛtɛ èè wolo Modekayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 5:9" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ, Haman ɛ tɔ ɛ da ɔsɛ waanɩ gɛ woturu wʋ nʋ̀n wɔ. Mɔ gɛtɛ ɛ ma tama Modekayi è si egyu-dɩrɛ wotunu, gɛ ɛn tɔ yela, gɛ ɛn ka gebù tɛ wɔ fɔ, ɛ ka owurufa-dɩrɛ Modekayi wo koro. <verse eid="EST 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 5:10" />Mɔ Haman e gye koro gepepe, gɛ ɛ san ɛ da wɔ dɩkpaara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 5:10">Ɛwʋ gɛ e kpèlè wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ ma wɔsɔ Seresi e tuma. <verse eid="EST 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 5:11" />Gɛ Haman ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ bʋma koro ɛ dama wo koro gaanyan kpekpesi gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba fɔ, ma wo bebi-teni kpekpesi, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ gingyebi ma anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ bʋma wɔ bɩndɩrɛ ɛ da gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ, ma bɛndɩrɛbi-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa egyu-dɩrɛ gatɩn powu fɔ. <verse eid="EST 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 5:12" />Gɛ Haman ɛ nɩ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nka ɛwʋ powu wʋ lɛ! Ɩ nya, miinko-kwan gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ-nanɩ Esita ɛ fɩna gʋlɔ e kpèlè alɛ, gɩsa n fɩya ma egyu-dɩrɛ, taà ba ɔsɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ pɩna fɔ waanɩ. <verse eid="EST 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 5:13" />Mɔ ade gbaa-gbaa gɛtɛ na kalan lɛ powu, ɩn tɛ nɩma mɩ, yema gɛtɛ ǹ bɔ ǹ nyɩ nte we Modekayi, Yuda-te nyawɔ e si egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara diitunu lɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 5:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ wɔsɔ Seresi ma wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ fɔ powu bɛ dɔ̀ Haman alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ bàà sere oyon gɛtɛ waatɔ waà mɛ anlɛ bɩsɩrɩ akpilin asiyee ma fwo-ton. Fɔ gɩsa gagyɩgyan àà fʋba a sa egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ yɛ bàà sa Modekayi ɔŋʋʋ gigyen bɛ kyɔlɔga ma oyon fɔ. Fɔ ɛyɩ ma egyu-dɩrɛ yàà san ɔsɛ fɔ wʋʋpɩ ɔsɛ waanɩ.&gt;&gt; Haman e to ade nyayɩ ɛ sa ɔsɛ waanɩ, gɛ ɛ yɛ be sere oyon fɔ.<verse eid="EST 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EST 6" />
  <para style="s1">Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ka gebù ɛ tɛ Modekayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 6:1" />Odente wʋtɔkɔ powu fɔ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛn taa talɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ fwa bʋda, okoro ɛ sa alɛ bɛ ma ka gɩkpa gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara ade gɛtɛ i sere-sere wo bugyu buu gedi bʋʋya waanɩ fɔ bɛ ba, fɔ bàà bɛ kalan gɩ bɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="EST 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 6:2" />Be we gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa dʋkɔ alɛ Modekayi e tiri Bigitan ma Teresi gɛtɛ bè di egyu-dɩrɛ bɛndɩrɛbi bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛɛ dɩyɛ wotunu fɔ bɔɔpɩ-fwe ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ onyun bàà wolo ɛwɔ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi fɔ.<verse eid="EST 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 6:3" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii gebù ma gutoro gii gele gɛ Modekayi e wura e ye ade nyayɩ yaanɩ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:3">Egyu bɛsaranyan be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛn mɛ gɩnyankɩ tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 6:4" />Egyu-dɩrɛ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan n sa kpata anɩ?&gt;&gt; Fɔ ɔya wʋtɔkɔ gɛ Haman ɛ bɔ e be gyu digyu-kpaara diikòro wʋʋ kpata fɔ anɩ, gɛtɛ ɛ̀ bɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ baà sa Modekayi gigyen ɔŋʋʋ ɛ kyɔlɔga ma oyon gɛtɛ ɛwɔ Haman e sere ɛ tɛ Modekayi gewolo fɔ wuu koro waade.<verse eid="EST 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 6:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ bɛsaranyan bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ &lt;&lt;Haman n sa kpata waanɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ alan,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:5">&lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ wɔ èè gyu ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 6:6" />Gɛtɛ Haman e gyu fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ sa gɛtɛ nte len nan sa gebù. Anʋn gɛ n mɛ n tɛ wɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:6">Fɔ Haman ɛ dɔ̀ wamɩnlɛ yaanɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan n nɩ sa fiya ma nmɩ gɛtɛ egyu ɛ̀ɛ̀ sa gebù?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EST 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 6:7" />Okoro e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɩ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ sa gebù fɔ, <verse eid="EST 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 6:8" />ɛ yɛ bàà ka bugyu bʋʋ gɛgba gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa, ma dibengyi gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sara dii koro fɔ, fɔ bàà ka egyu wɔ sɩka-sɩya gɩnyankɩ gyaga dii duyu dii koro. <verse eid="EST 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 6:9" />Fɔ àà tiri aa bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ baanɩ ɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba gebù, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka aa gɛgba fɔ e su ɛnɩ gɛtɛ aa len àà sa gebù fɔ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka wɔ gyaga dibengyi fɔ dii koro, fɔ èè ton dɩ silin ma ditele fɔ powu, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ gbɛrɛ kpen dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Anlɛ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ mɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ sa gebù fɔ!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 6:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Haman alan, &lt;&lt;Bilenten! San ma ka gɛgba-serelɛ fɔ ma dibengyi fɔ, fɔ àà mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ a bɔ a dɔ̀ mɩ fɔ tɛ Yuda-te Modekayi gɛtɛ è si digyu-kpaara diitunu fɔ. Kara kere ade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ fɔ waanɩ wʋkɩ ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 6:11" />Okoro Haman ɛ ma ka gɛgba-serelɛ fɔ ma dibengyi fɔ. Ɛ ka gɛgba fɔ ɛ sa Modekayi gɛ ɛ ka wɔ ɛ gyaga dibengyi fɔ dii koro e silin ma ditele, gɛ ɛɛ gbɛrɛ digbongbo alan, &lt;&lt;Anlɛ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛɛ mɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ sa gebù fɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 6:12" />Nyawʋ wʋʋ gama fɔ, Modekayi e biri ɛ san diigyu-kpaara diitunu. Mɔ Haman ɛ sa bɩsɩrɩ butu ɛ da dɩkpaara ma ɩnɩnfa. <verse eid="EST 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 6:13" />Gɛ Haman ɛ ma dɔ̀ wɔsɔ Seresi ma wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ powu ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ i sere wo koro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:13">Ɛwʋ gɛ wamɩnlɛ yɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma wɔsɔ Seresi bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ Modekayi bʋnʋn gɛ a di ɩnɩnfa lɛ, è di gɛ Yuda-te, an nan nɩ talɩ a biri a yela ma ɛwɔ, aà nyɩ̀ a nʋ̀n gɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EST 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 6:14" />Gɛtɛ boonyun wʋʋn tɛ nʋ̀n fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ be tiri aforobi fɔ bɛ bɛ ka Haman bilenten bɛ san ɔsɛ wuu gedi, gɛtɛ Esita ɛ pɩna fɔ waanɩ.<verse eid="EST 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EST 7" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛ sa Haman gigyen ɔŋʋʋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 7:1" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ ma Haman bɛ san bɛ ma di ma Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Esita. <verse eid="EST 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 7:2" />Duwi-nyɔɔfɛ daanɩ fɔ, gɛtɛ bè si bɛɛ nyʋn wayɩn fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ e biri e lila egyu-dɩrɛ-nanɩ Esita alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gbagbaagba gɛ aa len nàn mɛ ntɛ wɔ̀? Gengyi miin bugyu gba gɛ à len nan yo baanɩ kyɛkyɛ akpen anyɔɔ, fɔ nan ka dikpen dɩkɩ ntɛ wɔ̀ gba fɔ, nan mɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 7:3" />Gɛ Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Esita e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-kpara, gengyi maade ii di wɔ̀ gʋnʋn fɔ, ɛwʋ bɩrɛ, nte koturu wɔ̀ fɔ àà to ɛtɩ ma mɩɩn bɛnɩ nkpa. Nyawʋ n di maade lilalɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EST 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 7:4" />Yema alɛ, be fu nmɩ ma mɩɩn bɛnɩ bɛ tɛ gɛtɛ bàà wolo tɩ, bàà belen tɩ ayu, bàà muru tɩ. Gengyi wʋ̀ daà mɛ alɛ be fu tɩ, tàà mɛ bɛdɩ-teni ma bɛdɩ-nanɩ gba fɔ, nafɔ n daà gye miinyun n tin, yema gɛlɛ wʋʋ dɩyɩyɛ dɩn sɔ, gɛ nafɔ mɩn daà sa awɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ dɩfana.<verse eid="EST 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 7:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi e lila egyu-dɩrɛ-nanɩ Esita alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan gɛ wù di? Ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ fɔ ɛ̀ sa ganɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 7:6" />Esita e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Wù di gɛ Haman, tɩɩkyʋnlɛ ma tiikengbelilɛ ɛnɩ-kpen nyawɔ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:6">Dʋkɔ fɔ Haman e gyu gɩsaa-dɩrɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ma Esita bɔɔ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="EST 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 7:7" />Egyu-dɩrɛ woturu wʋ tɔ, gɛ e kere wɔ bʋkan gɛtɛ ɛɛ nyʋn fɔ ɛ ya, gɛ ɛ san ɛ ma gyu digyu-kpaara, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ bɛkɔkɔkɔ fɔ. Mɔ gɛtɛ Haman e we gɛtɛ wʋ̀ mɛ lann fɔ egyu-dɩrɛ eè tiira wɔ giten fɔ, ɛ wɔ egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Esita wakʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ fɔ wɔ fɔ èè to wɔ nkpa.<verse eid="EST 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 7:8" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ bɔ e biri e ye digyu-kpaara, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ bɛkɔkɔkɔ fɔ ɛ ba ɔsɛ fɔ waanɩ fɔ, fɔ Esita ɛ̀ dɔ gɛbɩya-kpasalɛ gaanɩ, gɛ Haman è kura è de egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Esita bɩsɩrɩ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Dʋkɔ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ fa alan, &lt;&lt;À ni biri aa nyanla miingyu-nanɩ nmɩ gbagba mɩɩn dɩkpaara daanɩ ɔya gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa ma nmɩ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Gɛtɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ bɩta bʋ bɔ bʋ nʋ̀n fɔ, be tin Haman wɔ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="EST 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 7:9" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ be tiri bɛ aforobi fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Aribona fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Haman ɛ yɛ be sere oyon bɛ gbɛma wɔ dɩkpaara, gɛtɛ waatɔ waà mɛ anlɛ bɩsɩrɩ akpilin asiyee ma fwo-ton. Ɛ sere wʋ gɛtɛ bàà sa Modekayi gɛtɛ e to wɔ̀ nkpa ɛ nya fɔ gigyen ɔŋʋʋ bɛ kyɔlɔga ma ɛwʋ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:9">Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ma sa Haman gigyen ɔŋʋʋ ɩ kyɔlɔga ma woyon gɛtɛ e sere fɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EST 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 7:10" />Okoro bɛ sa Haman gigyen ɔŋʋʋ bɛ kyɔlɔga ma oyon gɛtɛ ɛwɔ Haman ɛ yɛ be sere bɛ tɛ Modekayi fɔ. Dʋkɔ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ woturu wʋ nʋ̀n wɔ.<verse eid="EST 7:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EST 8" />
  <para style="s1">Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sɩ̀ ose gɛtɛ wàà kpa Yuda bete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 8:1" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ ke daanɩ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi ɛ ka Haman, Yuda bete bɔɔkyʋnlɛ fɔ waanyan powu ɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ-nanɩ Esita. Gɛ Modekayi e wura osele ɛ ba egyu-dɩrɛ wakʋn, yema Esita ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alɛ è di gɛ wɔfʋrɩ. <verse eid="EST 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 8:2" />Egyu e tiri wo gitola gɛtɛ wɔ dɩdawʋ dɩ̀ gyaga gii koro, gɛ e biri e to gi e ye Haman wakʋn fɔ, gɛ ka gi ɛ tɛ Modekayi. Gɛ Esita ɛ ka Haman waanyan fɔ ɛ sa Modekayi gʋlɔ.<verse eid="EST 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 8:3" />Esita e ni biri ɛ ka bʋnʋntu ɛ ma nʋ̀n egyu-dɩrɛ bɩsɩrɩ baanɩ. Ɛ fɔ wɔ gɛtɛ èè ten amɩnlɛ-kpen gɛtɛ Agagi-te Haman ɛ ka Yuda bete boo koro fɔ. <verse eid="EST 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 8:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi ɛ tʋna wo bugyu buuyon fɔ e wùlà Esita, gɛ Esita ɛ tɔ e be yela wɔ bʋnʋn.<verse eid="EST 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 8:5" />Gɛ Esita ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ, gengyi wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ wɔ, gɛ aa we mɩ gutunkoro fɔ, gɛ aa nya alɛ wù di ade-kpara gɛtɛ àà mɛ gɛlɛ fɔ, tɛ osele, fɔ bàà ŋwara ose-fon gɛtɛ waà kpa ɛwʋ gɛtɛ Agagi-te Hamedata wobi Haman ɛ ŋwara ɛ tɩyɛma alɛ be muru Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa ntʋnkwaa gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa aa gatɩn fɔ powu fɔ. <verse eid="EST 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 8:6" />Lan gɛ nan mɛ gengyi gyerebi ɛ̀ ba mɩɩn bɛnɩ boo koro fɔ? Lan gɛ nan mɛ gengyi bè wolo mɩɩn bɛfʋrɩ powu fɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 8:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ-nanɩ Esita ma Yuda-te Modekayi alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ Haman ɛ tɔ e yela Yuda bete boo koro fɔ, na ka waanyan na tɛ Esita, gɛ na yɛ bɛ sa wɔ gigyen ɔŋʋʋ bɛ gyɔlɔga ma oyon. <verse eid="EST 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 8:8" />Nkele ŋwara ose-fon ka da ma Yuda bete boo koro miin diyere daanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ wɔ̀, fɔ àà ka egyu-dɩrɛ dɩdawʋ gii gitola nyɩ gii koro. Yema gɩkpa gɩkɩ gɩn ma gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ŋwara gɩ egyu-dɩrɛ diyere daanɩ, gɛ bɛ̀ ka wɔ dɩdawʋ dii gitola bɛ nyɩ gɩ, gɛ ɛkɩ eè terema gɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 8:9" />Okoro ebon-siyeefɛ, gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Siwan fɔ duwi dikpilin ma esiyeefɛ daanɩ fɔ, be kpèlè egyu-dɩrɛ gɩkpa gɩɩ bɛŋwaralɛ be tuma. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara Modekayi wose, bàà ka bɛ tɩyɛma Yuda bete ma bɛndɩrɛbi kperen-kperen gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya ntʋnkwaa akpilin kooron ma kwarankɩ (127), gɛtɛ bɩ̀ sa ye Indiya gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ san Kusi gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ powu. Bɛ ŋwara ose-fon nyawʋ ginde-kamasɛ gaanɩ. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara wʋ ma ginde-kamasɛ gɩɩ gɛŋwarabi. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ bɛ ŋwara wʋ Yuda bete boo ginde gaanɩ ma bɔɔ gɛŋwarabi gaanɩ. <verse eid="EST 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 8:10" />Modekayi ɛ ŋwara akpa fɔ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi diyere daanɩ, gɛ bɛ ka wo gitola bɛ nyɩ ose fɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ ka ose nyawʋ bɛ sa egyu-dɩrɛ bɛsaranyan baalɔ yaanɩ. Bɛ ka egyu-dɩrɛ wabengyi gɛtɛ ɩ̀ ba ɔsa bɛ ma yo-yo akpa fɔ.<verse eid="EST 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 8:11" />Anyun-gyebi gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa ose fɔ waanɩ fɔ n di alɛ, Egyu ɛ tɛ Yuda bete osele gɛtɛ gengyi bɛkyʋnlɛ bɛkɩ bɛ̀ tɔ bè yela boo koro gɩfɩɩ-kamasɛ gaanɩ fɔ, osele wʋ̀ sa tɛ bɛ, gɛtɛ bàà kya be bo fɔ bàà kpà be to koro, fɔ bàà wolo bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ, fɔ bàà muru boo beteni, ma bɛnanɩ, ma boo bebi powu, fɔ bàà kpila bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ baanyan. <verse eid="EST 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 8:12" />Ebon fwo-nyɔɔfɛ, gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Ada fɔ, duwi-fwo-siyeefɛ fɔ, n di duwi gɛtɛ bɛ sɩ̀ alɛ, Yuda bete bɛ mɛ ade nyayɩ ntʋnkwaa powu, gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi gatɩn fɔ baanɩ. <verse eid="EST 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 8:13" />Wù di gɛtɛ anyun-gyebi gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa ose fɔ waanɩ fɔ yàà mɛ ose tɛ gɛtʋnkwaa-kamasɛ. Gɛ wù di gɛtɛ bàà kalan wʋ ɛkamasɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋn. Fɔ Yuda bete bàà wura pɩna koro bàà talɩ be wolo bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ baà tɔ be yela boo koro fɔ.<verse eid="EST 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 8:14" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ e tiri wɔ bɛsalɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ gyaga wabengyi gɛtɛ ɩ̀ ba ɔsa gepepe fɔ osele gɛ bɛ kya iti bɛ da. Bɛ sɩ̀ ose nyawʋ ditele-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Susa fɔ mɔ ke daanɩ.<verse eid="EST 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 8:15" />Gɛtɛ Modekayi e ye egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara ɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ, be su wɔ begyu bɔɔ ngba buluu, ma gifututu, gɛ è tin sɩka-sɩya digyu-koto-dɩrɛ gɛ ɛ sa dɩgyʋgʋsa-sɩya ɛ gyaga gigyu-gba fɔ gii koro. Ɛ̀ san fɔ, Susa ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛɛ gbɛrɛ afala ɔsɛ waanɩ. <verse eid="EST 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 8:16" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ, Yuda bete boo koro gɩ̀ nʋ̀n bɛ, be di ɔsɛ, be wura gebù. <verse eid="EST 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 8:17" />Gɛtʋnkwaa ma ditele-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ose nyawʋ wʋ ma gyu fɔ, Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ fɔ, be di, gɛ bɛ nyʋn ɔsɛ waanɩ. Gɛ wʋ ba gɛtɛ ntʋnkwaa fɔ baanɩ fɔ, bɛnɩ kpekpesi gɛtɛ ben di Yuda bete fɔ, be biligi Yuda bete, yema alɛ bè serenti Yuda bete fɔ okoro.<verse eid="EST 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EST 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda bete be di bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ boo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 9:1" />Ebon fwo-nyɔɔfɛ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Ada fɔ, wo duwi fwo disiyeefɛ daanɩ gɛ ose gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ waà sere gʋtʋn gɩɩ gɛmɛ. Duwi dɩtɔkɔ gɛ Yuda bete bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn bʋ̀ gyaga gɛtɛ baà di Yuda bete boo koro. Mɔ fɔ, ade i fi, gɛ Yuda bete be dì bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ boo koro. <verse eid="EST 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 9:2" />Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa ntʋnkwaa gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi gatɩn fɔ powu be tuma baatele yaanɩ, gɛ bɛ pɩna koro gɛtɛ bàà tà bɩtà ma bɛkyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ onyun alɛ baà wolo ɛbɛ Yuda bete fɔ. Okoro ɛkɩ ɛn talɩ e yela Yuda bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn, yema bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ powu bè serenti kààrà. <verse eid="EST 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 9:3" />Gɛ gebù gɩɩ bɛnɩ, ma gɩfɩɩ gɩɩ bɛnyalɛ, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè yela egyu gɩsɩrɩ, gɛ bɛɛ nya ntʋnkwaa fɔ powu buu koro fɔ, be yela Yuda bete bɔɔ gama, yema bè serenti Modekayi. <verse eid="EST 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 9:4" />Modekayi è di gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ wɔndɩrɛbi gbaa. Gɛ e di diyere gɩfɩɩ fɔ powu gaanɩ, gɛ ɛ̀ bɔ ee wura ɔkɛma ɛ fɩya.<verse eid="EST 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 9:5" />Okoro Yuda bete fɔ be wolo bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ gɛ be muru bɛ powu, gɛ bɛ mɛ bɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bè len. <verse eid="EST 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 9:6" />Susa ditele-dɩrɛ diiko daanɩ fɔ Yuda bete be wolo bɛkyʋnlɛ nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin ton (500) be muru. <verse eid="EST 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 9:7" />Gɛlɛ ke be wolo Parisanidata, ma Dalifon, ma Asipata <verse eid="EST 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 9:8" />ma Porata, ma Adaliya, ma Aridata, <verse eid="EST 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 9:9" />ma Parimasita, ma Arisayi, ma Aridayi, ma Fayisata, <verse eid="EST 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 9:10" />gɛtɛ ɛbɛ n di Amedata wobi Haman, gɛtɛ ɛ kyʋn Yuda bete fɔ, wo bebi-tenibi fwo fɔ. Mɔ Yuda bete fɔ ben kpila baanyan da anlɛ gɛtɛ bee kpila bɩtà baanyan fɔ.<verse eid="EST 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 9:11" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ ke gɛ bɛ ma dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be wolo Susa ditele daanɩ fɔ baasɔ. <verse eid="EST 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 9:12" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Esita alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi Yuda bete be wolo bɛkyʋnlɛ nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin ton (500) fɩya ma Haman bebi-tenibi fwo Susa ditele diiko daanɩ fɔ, ɛwʋ bɩrɛ ntʋnkwaa-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ baanɩ bɩrɛ, aan kya! Anʋn gɛ aa fɔ mɩ? Baà mɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ! Anʋn gɛ aa len a ye maakʋn? Waà kya wɔ̀ gʋlɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 9:13" />Gɛ Esita ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-kpara, gengyi gɛ waà pe fɔ, tɛ Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Susa ditele fɔ osele, fɔ gɩsa bàà ni biri be di dɩbʋn gɛtɛ ǹdò be di lɛ. Fɔ àà yɛ bàà sa Haman bebi-tenibi fwo fɔ boo gikpena ɔŋʋʋ gigyen kyɔlɔga ma oyon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EST 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 9:14" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ osele gɛtɛ bàà mɛ gɛlɛ. Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ sɩ̀ ose ade nyayɩ yii koro Susa ditele. Gɛ bɛ sa Haman bebi-tenibi fwo fɔ boo gikpena ɔŋʋʋ gigyen bɛ kyɔlɔga ma oyon fɔ. <verse eid="EST 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 9:15" />Yuda bete be ni biri be tuma ebon gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Ada fɔ wo duwi fwo-naafɛ daanɩ. Gɛ be ni wolo bɛkyʋnlɛ gɛkpɩn ma akpilin ton (300) Susa ditele daanɩ. Mɔ ben kpila baanyan anlɛ gɛtɛ bee kpila bɩtà baanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="EST 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 9:16" />Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa egyu-dɩrɛ ntʋnkwaa-kurumakyɛɛ baanɩ fɔ mɔ, be tuma, gɛ bɛ kpà be to koro be ye bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ bɔɔ gatɩn. Yuda bete bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ be wolo fɔ baà mɛ anlɛ bɛnɩ asepekyi asiyee ma ɩgbaa kwarankɩ ma nkpɩn ton (75,000). Mɔ bɛn kpila baanyan anlɛ gɛtɛ bee kpila bɩtà baanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="EST 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 9:17" />Ade nyayɩ i sere gɛ Ada wobon fɔ duwi-fwo-siyeefɛ fɔ daanɩ. Duwi-fwo dɩnaafɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, Yuda bete be tuna, gɛ bɛ mɛ dɩ duwi-dɩrɛ ma ɔsɛ wuu duwi.<verse eid="EST 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Be di Puri wɔsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 9:18" />Mɔ Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Susa ditele daanɩ fɔ, be tuma ebon ɛtɔkɔ duwi-fwo-siyeefɛ fɔ ma duwi fwo-naafɛ fɔ yaanɩ. Be tuna duwi fwo-tonfɛ fɔ daanɩ, gɛ bɛ mɛ dɩ duwi-dɩrɛ ma ɔsɛ wuu duwi.<verse eid="EST 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 9:19" />Nyawʋ wuu koro gɛ Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa atelebi yaanɩ fɔ, bɛ mɛ Ada duwi fwo-naafɛ fɔ ɔsɛ wuu duwi ma duwi-dɩrɛ, ma duwi gɛtɛ bɛɛ tɛ bɛwɔlɔn anyan fɔ.<verse eid="EST 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 9:20" />Modekayi ɛ yɛ bɛ ŋwara ade nyayɩ powu bɛ sa akpa yaanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ tɩyɛma Yuda bete powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa ntʋnkwaa gɛtɛ bɩ̀ sa Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi bugyu bɔɔ gatɩn fɔ. <verse eid="EST 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 9:21" />Ɛ ŋwara alɛ wù di gɛtɛ ɛkamasɛ èè di Ada wobon duwi fwo-naafɛ ma fwo-tonfɛ fɔ gɛtɛ ì di awi-dɩrɛ fɔ yii koro gɩkyan n di gɩkyan. <verse eid="EST 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 9:22" />Yema awi ɩtɔkɔ gɛ Yuda bete be to koro be ye bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ. Nkele mɔ ebon ɛtɔkɔ wanɩ gɛ bɔɔ dɩkpʋkpʋ di biligi ɔsɛ wʋ tɛ bɛ, gɛ boo gewula gi biligi ɔsɛ wuu gedi. Wù di gɛtɛ awi ɩtɔkɔ yàà mɛ awi-dɩrɛ ma ɔsɛ waawi, ma gɛtɛ̀ bɛwɔlɔn anyandilɛ, ma gɛkyɛ beyenpu anyan waawi.<verse eid="EST 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 9:23" />Okoro Yuda bete bɛ tɛrɛma Modekayi wade-wùlàlɛ fɔ, bɛ ka ɔsɛ wuu gedi fɔ bɛ mɛ ɔkɔnʋn. <verse eid="EST 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EST 9:24" />Yema alɛ nafɔ Agagi-te Amedata wobi Haman gɛtɛ è di Yuda bete bɔɔkyʋnlɛ fɔ e len gɛtɛ èè muru Yuda bete powu. Gɛ ɛ da ma Puri wataa yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀ yii koro e tiri duwi gɛtɛ eè muru bɛ. <verse eid="EST 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EST 9:25" />Waanɩ fɔ, gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, ɛ yɛ bɛ ŋwara gɩkpa alɛ Haman dɩmɩnlɛ-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ ka Yuda bete boo koro fɔ di biri ɛwɔ gbagba wo koro. Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ sa ɛwɔ Haman ma wo bebi-tenibi gigyen ɔŋʋʋ bɛ kyɔlɔga ma oyon gɛtɛ ɛwɔ Haman e sere fɔ. <verse eid="EST 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EST 9:26" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛ bee kpèlè awi nyayɩ alɛ, Purim fɔ. Purim nyawʋ wu ye gɛ digyebi Puri daanɩ. Yema ade gɛtɛ Modekayi ɛ ŋwara, ma Yuda bete baade gɛtɛ be we, ma ade gɛtɛ i sere boo koro fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="EST 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EST 9:27" />Yuda bete bɛ ka ade nyayɩ bɛ mɛ ɔkɔnʋn bɛ tɛ ɛbɛ ma boodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ, ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bee len bàà mɛ koro Yuda bete fɔ powu. Be to awi anyɔɔ nyayɩ bɛ sa gɛtɛ ì di awi-dɩrɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sɩ̀ alɛ bɛ tɩ mɛ ɔya fɔ waanɩ kyɛkyɛɛkyɛ gɩkyan-kamasɛ fɔ. <verse eid="EST 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EST 9:28" />Wù di gɛtɛ Yuda bete boodu waanɩ powu, ma baakpaara powu, ma baatele-dɩrɛ ma ntʋnkwaa powu bàà kʋna be di awi nyayɩ yii koro. Gɛ wun di gɛtɛ bàà kere Purim wawi yii gedi bɛ ya kpakpaakpa, gɛ wun di gɛtɛ bàà finla yɩ.<verse eid="EST 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EST 9:29" />Okoro Abiyali wobi egyu-dɩrɛ-nanɩ Esita ɛ fɩya ma Yuda-te Modekayi, gɛ bɛ ŋwara gɩkpa-nyɔɔfɛ. Bɛ ka bootimi powu bɛ ŋwara gɛtɛ ɛkamasɛ èè to Purim sa. <verse eid="EST 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EST 9:30" />Gɛ Modekayi ɛ ka akpa fɔ ɛ tɩyɛma Yuda bete powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa ntʋnkwaa akpilin kooron ma kwarankɩ (127) gɛtɛ bɩ̀ sa Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi gatɩn fɔ baanɩ. E lila olila ma nʋnkwarɩ ɛ tɛ bɛ. <verse eid="EST 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EST 9:31" />Gɛ bɛ sa bɛ aniya gɛtɛ bàà di Purim wawi fɔ yii koro kyɛkyɛɛkyɛ ma anlɛ gɛtɛ Yuda-te Modekayi, ma egyu-dɩrɛ-nanɩ Esita bɛ ŋwara alɛ ɛbɛ, ma boodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bàà di yii koro fɔ. Fɔ bàà ban onyun, fɔ bàà sara dɩkpʋkpʋ daanɩ. <verse eid="EST 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EST 9:32" />Bɛ ŋwara Egyu-nanɩ-dɩrɛ Esita wose gɛtɛ ɛ sɩ̀ ka da ma Puri wawi yii gedi yii koro fɔ bɛ sa gɩkpa gaanɩ.<verse eid="EST 9:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EST 10" />
  <para style="s1">Modekayi bɩndɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 10:1" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi ɛ sɩ̀ ose ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè si wo bugyu buu gedikʋn bʋʋ gɩlan ka san getu giinyun fɔ powu alɛ, wù di gɛtɛ ɛkamasɛ èè le lonpoo. <verse eid="EST 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 10:2" />Bɛ ŋwara Modekayi waade-mɛlɛ, ma wɔkɛma, wade fɩya ma wɔ bɩndɩrɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sɩ̀ wɔ fɔ bɛ sa Mediya ma Perisiya begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yaakpa yaanɩ. <verse eid="EST 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 10:3" />Yuda-te Modekayi ɛ mɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Herihesi wɔmalɛ. E wura gebù-dɩrɛ wɔ bɛfʋrɩ Yuda bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ e di diyere wɔ bɛnɩ Yuda bete baanɩ. Yema alɛ ɛ kpà ɛ tɛ boo gepe. Gɛ ɛ nya gɛtɛ wɔ bɛnɩ powu bɛ sara olila waanɩ.<verse eid="EST 10:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 10" />
</usx>